    [BugFix] Reject legacy DSA-CP with Model Runner V2 (#18206)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Reject DSA-CP with Model Runner V2 and suggest using PCP. Update the
    configuration and usage docs.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    MRV2 with `enable_dsa_cp=true` now raises a configuration error.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    `./format.sh ci` passed. No UT changes; UT and NPU tests were not run.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
    ---------
    
    Signed-off-by: leolee <yihao.li@huawei.com>

